risks.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Companies can measure whether code was written, products shipped, or bugs fixed, making those tasks easier to automate.","zh":null},{"en":"Deciding what should be built in the first place is harder.","zh":null},{"en":"It requires judgment, context, tradeoffs, and a willingness to take risks.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>As OpenAI put it: \"People still set our research priorities, judge which ideas and results to pursue, and decide whether to scale, pause, or deploy systems.\"</p>","sentences":[{"en":"As OpenAI put it: \"People still set our research priorities, judge which ideas and results to pursue, and decide whether to scale, pause, or deploy systems.\"","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>In other words, the future of human work may shift away from execution and toward making the right decisions.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"In other words, the future of human work may shift away from execution and toward making the right decisions.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><strong><em>Sign up for the AI Insider newsletter </em></strong><a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/subscription/newsletter/tech-memo\" data-track-click=\"{&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;body_link&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;}\" rel=\"\">here</a><strong><em>. Reach out to me via email at </em></strong><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"mailto:abarr@businessinsider.com\" data-track-click=\"{&quot;click_type&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;body_link&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;outbound_click&quot;}\" rel=\" nofollow\">abarr@businessinsider.com</a></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Sign up for the AI Insider newsletter here.","zh":null},{"en":"Reach out to me via email at abarr@businessinsider.com","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2>\n                        Read next\n                      </h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Read next","zh":"阅读下