stair Barr is the driving force behind Business Insider's <a href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/category/ai-insider\">AI Insider</a> franchise, including the AI Insider newsletter. <a href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/subscription/newsletter/tech-memo\">Sign up here</a>. Before that, he was Business Insider's Global Tech Editor and the Big Tech team leader at Bloomberg, following a reporting career at The Wall Street Journal, USA Today, Reuters, and MarketWatch. Alistair covers all things Big Tech, along with startups and venture capital. He writes analysis and columns about topics including AI, cloud computing, data centers, semiconductors, online search, e-commerce, EVs, robotics, and autonomous vehicles.</span>\n              </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Alistair Barr is the driving force behind Business Insider's AI Insider franchise, including the AI Insider newsletter.","zh":null},{"en":"Sign up here.","zh":"在这里注册。"},{"en":"Before that, he was Business Insider's Global Tech Editor and the Big Tech team leader at Bloomberg, following a reporting career at The Wall Street Journal, USA Today, Reuters, and MarketWatch.","zh":"在此之前，他曾担任《商业内幕》的全球科技编辑和彭博社的大型科技团队负责人，此前他曾在《华尔街日报》、《今日美国》、路透社和 MarketWatch 从事报道工作。"},{"en":"Alistair covers all things Big Tech, along with startups and venture capital.","zh":"阿利斯泰尔涵盖了大型科技的所有内容，以及初创公司和风险投资。"},{"en":"He writes analysis and columns about topics including AI, cloud computing, data centers, semiconductors, online search, e-commerce, EVs, robotics, and autonomous vehicles.","zh":"他撰写的分析和专栏涉及人工智能、云计算、数据中心、半导体、在线搜索、电子商务、电动汽车、机器人和自动驾驶汽车等主题。"}]},{"html_en":"<li>\n                  <a data-track-click=\"\" href=\"/category/openai\" title=\"OpenAI\">OpenAI</a>\n                </li>","sentences":[{"en":"OpenAI","zh":"开放人工智能"}]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><section data-content-container=\"\" role=\"main\">\n\n  \n    \n  \n    <div data-load-strategy=\"disable-lazy\" data-component-type=\"post-top\">\n  \n        \n        \n        \n          <section id=\"post-headline\">\n            <h2>OpenAI reveals the AI-era workplace skills that matter most</h2>\n        \n          </section>\n          \n          \n          \n            <div data-component-type=\"post-byline\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-byline\">\n                      <a data-e2e-name=\"byline-author-image\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/author/alistair-barr\">\n                            <div data-slug=\"\">\n                                <p><img data-old-src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 1 1'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" src=\"https://i.insider.com/67e46b3b63d72727e1985905?crop=1:1&width=256&format=jpeg&auto=webp&saturation=-100\" alt=\"Alistair Barr, global tech editor of Business Insider, smiles at the camera while wearing a blue and white striped shirt.\">\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              </p>  </div>\n                        </a>\n                      <p>作者：Alistair Barr 您目前正在关注该作者！ Click to unsubscribe from email alerts. Author of the AI Insider newsletter</p></div>\n      </div>\n\n  <section>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n      <section id=\"post-body\" data-component-type=\"post-body\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-lock-content=\"\">\n            \n            \n            \n            <div data-component-type=\"post-hero\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\">\n                  <figure data-type=\"img\" data-e2e-name=\"image-figure-image\" data-media-container=\"image\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ImageObject\">\n                      <div>\n                        <meta itemprop=\"contentUrl\" content=\"https://i.insider.com/6aab22f416256d3825fdec9e?width=1200\">\n                        <p><img src=\"https://i.insider.com/6aab22f416256d3825fdec9e?width=700\" srcset=\"https://i.insider.com/6aab22f416256d3825fdec9e?width=400&format=jpeg&auto=webp 400w, https://i.insider.com/6aab22f416256d3825fdec9e?width=500&format=jpeg&auto=webp 500w, https://i.insider.com/6aab22f416256d3825fdec9e?width=700&format=jpeg&auto=webp 700w, https://i.insider.com/6aab22f416256d3825fdec9e?width=1000&format=jpeg&auto=webp 1000w, https://i.insider.com/6aab22f416256d3825fdec9e?width=1300&format=jpeg&auto=webp 1300w, https://i.insider.com/6aab22f416256d3825fdec9e?width=2000&format=jpeg&auto=webp 2000w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 900px\" alt=\"SAN FRANCISCO, CALIFORNIA - SEPTEMBER - 15: OpenAI CEO Sam Altman sits for a conversation with Salesforce CEO Marc Benioff at Salesforce's Dreamforce conference at the Moscone Center on September 15, 2026 in San Francisco, California. Dreamforce is an annual event that highlights the company's technologies and encourages professional networking. (Photo by Benjamin Fanjoy/Getty Images)\" decoding=\"sync\">\n                      </p></div>\n                  \n                    <span>\n                      <span data-e2e-name=\"image-source\" itemprop=\"creditText\">Benjamin Fanjoy/Getty Images</span>  </span>\n                  </figure>\n            </div>\n    \n    \n    \n            \n      \n              \n      \n      \n            \n      \n              \n              \n              \n              \n      \n            \n      \n        <section data-load-strategy=\"lazy\" data-component-type=\"image-modal\" data-track-content=\"\" data-post-type=\"story\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-body-content\">\n                  \n                      <p>OpenAI recently published one of the clearest signals yet about which workplace skills may become most valuable in the AI era.</p><p>In a report on how its researchers use AI, the company shared data showing which tasks are being absorbed by AI and which still rely on people.</p><p>The biggest automation gains this year came in coding, technical support, monitoring computer runs, and analyzing results. By contrast, AI is still doing relatively little work deciding what projects to pursue, where to invest resources, or how to set priorities.</p><p>This offers a glimpse of where the value of work may shift.</p><p>Companies can measure whether code was written, products shipped, or bugs fixed, making those tasks easier to automate. Deciding what should be built in the first place is harder. It requires judgment, context, tradeoffs, and a willingness to take risks.</p><p>As OpenAI put it: \"People still set our research priorities, judge which ideas and results to pursue, and decide whether to scale, pause, or deploy systems.\"</p><p>In other words, the future of human work may shift away from execution and toward making the right decisions.</p><p>Sign up for the AI Insider newsletter here. Reach out to me via email at abarr@businessinsider.com</p>\n                  \n                  \n                  </section>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n      </section>\n\n    \n    <!-- Included desktop \"post-aside\" -->  \n\n    \n      \n      <section data-component-type=\"post-bottom\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-bottom\">\n        <section>\n    \n    \n            \n            \n    \n              \n                \n                \n                <section data-component-type=\"dad-related-posts\" data-delay-third-party-scripts=\"true\" data-size=\"4\" data-min-size=\"3\" data-container-index=\"\" data-included-verticals=\"artificial-intelligence\" data-placement=\"post-bottom\" data-track-marfeel=\"dad-related-posts-post-bottom\" data-excluded-verticals=\"bi-video\" data-root-margin=\"250px 0px\" data-track-view=\"{&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;end_of_article_recirc&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;subscription_experience&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;}\">\n                    <p>\n                      </p><h2>阅读下一篇</h2>\n                    <p></p>\n              \n              \n               